 to display on the map by creating feature objects and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"adding them to an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"text":" using the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shape:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" method or"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition to adding data to the map, you can also extract data from the map:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleFeaturesAtPoint:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and related methods return feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects that correspond to features in the source. This enables you to inspect"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the properties of features in vector tiles loaded by "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects. You also reuse these feature objects as overlay annotations."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While it is possible to add "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":"-conforming objects to the map as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotations using "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/addAnnotations:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and related methods, doing so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has trade-offs:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Features added as annotations will not have "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature\/identifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature\/attributes","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties when used with feature querying."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Features added as annotations become interactive. Taps and selection can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handled in "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:didSelectAnnotation:"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or they may be defined by local